{"path":"string/basic_string_view/operator_ltlt","title":"operator<<(std::basic_string_view)","titleHtml":"operator&lt;&lt;<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::basic_string_view)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/operator_ltlt","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Behaves as a FormattedOutputFunction. After constructing and checking the sentry object, determines the output format padding.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/string_view\">&lt;string_view&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1254\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Behaves as a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/FormattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">FormattedOutputFunction</em></a>. After constructing and checking the sentry object, <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/FormattedOutputFunction#Padding\">determines the output format padding</a>.\n</p><p>Then stores each character from the resulting sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">seq</span></code> (the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v</span></code> with padding) to the output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputn<span class=\"br0\">(</span>seq, n<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/max\"><span class=\"kw1652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">max</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>os.<span class=\"me1\">width</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, str.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>Finally, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os.<span class=\"me1\">width</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> to cancel the effects of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\">std::setw</a></span>, if any.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/failure\">std::ios_base::failure</a></span> if an exception is thrown during output.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a character output stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> v\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the view to be inserted\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> width<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// fill/left/right properties are kept until changed</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setfill\"><span class=\"kw1812\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setfill</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'-'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/left\"><span class=\"kw1796\">std::<span class=\"me2\">left</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/left\"><span class=\"kw1797\">std::<span class=\"me2\">right</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>width<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// width is reset after each call</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[abc--]\n[abc--]\n[--abc]\n[abc]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/operator_ltltgtgt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span><span>operator&gt;&gt;</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs stream input and output on strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string_view","title":"std::basic_string_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator<<(std::basic_string_view)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Behaves as a FormattedOutputFunction."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw std::ios_base::failure if an exception is thrown during output."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"os, v"},{"label":"Return value","note":"os"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator<<, operator>>","note":"performs stream input and output on strings"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":198,"codeBlockCount":2}
